{"id":"633220","name":"泡菜厚蛋烧","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/633220/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"4个"},{"name":"泡菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"泡菜切小块。","img":"images/633220/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋搅散，加料酒搅匀，加泡菜搅匀。","img":"images/633220/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切葱花，放入，搅匀。","img":"images/633220/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅预热，倒油。","img":"images/633220/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入三分之一蛋液，煎熟。","img":"images/633220/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"卷起来，倒入另外三分之一蛋液。","img":"images/633220/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再倒入三分之一蛋液。","img":"images/633220/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煎熟，没卷好。","img":"images/633220/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"切小块。","img":"images/633220/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/633220/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}